    "text": "Los Baños Enterprise\nwebsite\nLivingston\nFOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE July 21, 2025 FATAL HEAD ON TRAFFIC CRASH INVOLVING AWRONG WAY DRIVER ON STATE ROUTE 99\n1 days ago\nLivingston, Calif. On July 21, 2025, at approximately 2:12 a.m., Merced Communication Center (MCC) received a report of a head-on traffic crash in the area of State Route 99, south of Hammatt Avenue. Upon arrival to the scene, CHP officers determined this to be a three-vehicle head on crash with one fatality.\n2",
